{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41478","headline":"春雪 · 李建勳","name":"春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"随风竟日势漫漫，特地繁於故岁看。\n幽榭冻黏花屋重，短檐斜湿燕巢寒。\n闲听不寐诗魂爽，净吃无厌酒肺乾。\n莫道便爲桑麦药，亦胜焦涸到春残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}